11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
When the folding strength is zero, the folding angle will work.

12
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:38,000
When the folding angle is less than 180 degrees, fold outward. When the folding angle is greater than 180 degrees, fold inward.

13
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,000
But when the folding strength is higher, the angle of the folding angle is set according to the direction.

14
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
When the folding strength is higher than 180 degrees, the angle of the folding angle is set according to the direction.

15
